cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "I-GraphECG: gray-box graph electrophysiology surrogate for the 12-lead ECG"
abstract: >-
  Source code, configurations, trained encoder checkpoints and derived per-record tables
  for the I-GraphECG study. An encoder maps a 12-lead median beat to a bounded
  47-dimensional set of equivalent electrophysiological descriptors; a constrained
  eight-node conduction-graph decoder reconstructs the signal; disease prediction and
  observability-based lead selection are computed from the descriptors.
